WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:14.700
A coalition of five nations--So,
Gi, En, Kan, and Sho--

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.910
had attacked the kingdom of Chin,

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:24.670
an unprecedented crisis masterminded
by the great Sho general Ri Boku.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:29.590
In response, Chin summoned
all of its best generals,

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:32.760
and, united as a nation,
resolved to face the invaders.

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:39.350
Their battle with the coalition army
centered on Chin's great national barrier

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.310
at Kankoku Pass.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:44.270
Charge!

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:45.980
Charge, Hi Shin Force!

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.490
Commander Shin of Chin's
thousand-man Hi Shin Force

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:52.160
provided support to Lord Hyou's army.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:53.410
Plow on through!

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:56.990
Lord Hyou's army found itself
cornered by Sho's general, Kei Sha.

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:00.960
The fire has been lit
here on our battlefield.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.000
But...

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:06.090
Den Yuu! Den Ei! Hoist the flags!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:07.750
"Hi"

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.590
"Hi"                                                                  "Chin"

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:10.510
...the Hi Shin Force saved them.

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:13.970
Meanwhile, at Kankoku Pass,

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:16.100
the Gi army, led by Go Hou Mei,

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:21.730
attacked with a massive siege tower
developed for just this purpose.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:41.410
The Gi soldiers were poised
to invade at Kankoku Pass.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.510
Rise of a Young General

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:21.260
We've got a bridge onto Kankoku Pass!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.770
"Not once in a hundred years," my ass!

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:28.730
We Gi soldiers are putting an end
to the history of Kankoku Pass!

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:30.270
Get on up there!

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.810
"Gi"

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.860
Infantry, climb up here!

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:33.650
Go on!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:34.990
Go!

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:36.860
Focus your fire on the ladders!

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.030
Pick off the advancing enemies!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.530
Archers, cover the ladders!

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:44.040
Secure the top of the wall!

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:45.580
S-Stop!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.120
Go! Keep going!

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:51.130
Archers, fall back!

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:53.250
C'mon, get moving!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.840
Mou Gou, sir! The Chou Tou Army--

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.050
This won't do!

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:59.090
Send reinforcements to the right!

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:00.010
What are you doing?

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.760
We need more infantry!

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:07.270
Getting overpowered that quickly?
Pretty lame, old man!

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:09.900
It's not especially funny...

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:12.400
If they don't send reinforcements,
the foe will reach us!

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.070
--Wha--
--Huh?!

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:22.870
Eh?!

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:25.290
M-Mou Gou, sir!

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:26.950
Dear me.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:34.290
"Kan"

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:32.540
A second identical
siege tower is approaching!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:39.470
Sei Kai, sir, that tower's headed
into the Kan army's midst!

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:42.470
Very well. Let them through.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:43.970
Sir!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:48.640
It would seem even a toy can be
a weapon if it's grand enough.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:53.230
I can't believe Go Hou Mei would
actually bring <i>two </i>of those things.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:56.280
Gi's got itself an...
<i>unusual </i>general, all right.

00:04:56.280 --> 00:05:00.570
The success of the first confirms
the same for the second.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:03.490
That one will be setting out
a bridge to Kankoku Pass, too.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:06.990
It's headed this way?!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:10.790
That big old tower is
headed this way! To <i>us</i>!

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.330
Uh-oh--it's coming this way!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.330
Boss!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.960
Enough fussing, you dimwits.

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:22.220
Well, if they insist... I'll play along.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.970
Ordo, sir!

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.600
Report from the advance party!

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.980
The enemy's mountain stronghold
is more robust than expected!

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:40.860
Ou Sen's stronghold... They say
not even Ren Pa could touch it.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:43.820
I'd like to see that.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:49.950
But there's been a lot of noise
from the lefthand battlefield...

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:55.130
Don't tell me Kankoku Pass
is on the verge of falling!

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:57.380
Now, come on--

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:00.010
if you lot make it in
through the front door,

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:02.840
those of us fighting
for a mountain approach

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:07.220
won't have anything left to do!

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:07.300
"En"

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:13.690
There's another bridge here!

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:16.110
Don't let them climb! Stop them!

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.020
Wh-What's going on?!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.490
The Chou Tou Army is holding its ground,

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:24.030
but the status of the
 Kan Ki Army is unclear!

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:26.320
Kan Ki...

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.580
They just keep coming, one after another!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:38.710
What now? What the heck
should O Gi Ko do?!

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.710
O Gi Ko!

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:45.090
If you're free, come give me a hand.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.180
Eh?

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:58.020
"Gi"

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:59.440
Gi owes a substantial debt to Chin.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:02.110
Three years ago, our great general Go Kei

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.570
was slain at Dakan Plain.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:11.160
Last year, our army had its most crucial
stronghold at Sanyou stolen away.

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:18.460
This is where I, Go Hou Mei,
will settle Gi's debt of suffering!

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:23.800
Fall, Kankoku Pass, and take that
"impenetrable" legend with you!

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:31.810
Hmm?

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:38.520
Huh?

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:39.690
Barrels?

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:43.030
Th-They <i>stink</i>!

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:45.650
Is this... oil?!

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:50.490
Don't you think you guys...

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:55.120
...went a little overboard
building these suckers?

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:00.420
Sto--

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.430
A-Amazing...

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:17.140
He got them all in one fell swoop!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:21.310
Don't get too excited there, pal.

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:22.940
Why, you...

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:25.690
Burn, baby, burn!

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:29.200
Serves you right, you idiots!

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:33.370
Where did he even find that much oil?

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:36.540
Seems he nicked it from a
storehouse of reserves in Kanyou.

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:37.660
Cleaned it out.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:38.750
What?!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.420
As expected from your righthand man, sir.

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:47.630
Chou Tou, sir! The siege towers!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.760
How did they get their
hands on that much oil?!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:55.100
Damn mountain bandits...

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:59.560
Fret not, men! We have
no need for clever schemes!

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:02.060
Even if the enemy should climb this gate,

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.270
think of it as a land battle:

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:07.740
the enemy surrounded
as they plummet off a cliff!

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:09.950
Our army's position will remain unchanged!

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:13.450
Drive every last one of them
into the very ground!

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:23.170
Who is that man?

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:25.090
According to the scout's report,

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:29.880
his army's flags bore
the character "Kan."

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.470
I see.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:36.010
So you're the one who killed
General Haku Ki Sai at Sanyou:

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:37.720
Kan Ki.

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:49.190
All that hard work crafting two great
towers, and one of them is cinders.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:52.400
Ordo must be
crying tears of frustration.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:58.120
I can't speak to the man's feelings,
but the towers got the job done.

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:00.910
That they did.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:05.080
Placing bridges on Kankoku Pass
at such an early stage--

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:09.800
that alone may well have greatly tilted
the balance of battle in our favor.

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:14.130
Besides, there's more
in store for this battlefield.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:16.300
Right.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.260
Kan's commanding general...

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:21.390
Sei Kai has not yet made his move.

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:35.110
To the left of Kankoku Pass and
separated by a chain of mountains

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:39.330
lay a neighboring battlefield
out of every army's line of sight.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:40.610
"Chin"

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:40.540
And there...

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:41.820
"So"

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:48.630
the allied army of Mou Bu and Tou,
90 thousand men strong,

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:52.970
was engaged in all-out battle with
the So army's 150 thousand troops.

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:55.130
Get in there!

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:59.430
S-Stop them in their tracks!

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.480
Nice fence you got there, idiots!

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.890
First So Army Battalion

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:10.360
What's wrong, Chin? 
Is that all you got?

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:13.900
Right side! Give us covering
fire in front of Kou Yoku's squad!

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:19.870
Yahoo! Much obliged, Rei, damn you!

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.450
First So Army Battalion

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:28.040
Word is the great general Mou Bu is Chin's
most renowned daredevil of a general.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:31.550
So why's he planted in
the foothills, not budging?

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:35.550
Trembling at the thought of
the So army's raw power, huh?

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:38.390
Like a knock-kneed calf!

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:41.970
"Gaku"

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:45.720
Tou Army, Gaku Ka Force Battalion

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.140
This is new.

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:49.610
Mou Bu is always
the first to charge right in.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:50.980
"Chin"

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.440
"Mou"

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:58.660
It comes down to tactics.

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:00.200
Tactics?

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.620
Rin Bou's squad, incoming!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.870
We're making the first move!

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:09.170
Mou Ten, sir!

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:10.170
Move out!

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:13.590
Gaku Ka Force, keep pace with
Rin Bou's squad and provide support!

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.550
Father?

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:29.060
I-I'll take my leave.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:33.520
What are you doing here?

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:36.110
I thought you were with Tou's squad.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:37.820
Well, you know--

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:41.740
I was just wondering how
we're looking--tactics-wise.

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:44.490
Grandpa usually gives me
a sneak preview, so...

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.250
Oh?

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:47.910
Guess not.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.710
Still,

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:53.790
if we charge into that 150-thousand-man
So army with no plan,

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.460
we'll never win.

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:59.760
You came here to tell me <i>that</i>?

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:01.720
<i>That </i>much I know.

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:05.060
Oh! Well, that's good.

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:08.230
How about this, then:

00:13:08.230 --> 00:13:11.150
Why was I assigned to the Tou Army?

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:19.780
You know what? Never mind.

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:22.240
This is what I <i>really </i>came to say:

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:26.580
I wish you luck, Father.

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:31.830
Bye.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.840
The enemy forces consist of three armies.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:38.710
Fifty thousand troops each,
for a total of 150 thousand.

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:43.930
The So general is with
the third army, bringing up the rear.

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:49.850
I'm after the So
commanding general's head.

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:52.100
You could have Tou's men
go after their first army--

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.940
That's the plan.

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:58.650
The Tou Army mobilizes first,
attacking the first So army.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:02.780
Strike the front to draw out
the So general in the back, eh?

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.330
Ten.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:21.670
Good luck.

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:25.300
Don't let Rin Bou's
squad get ahead of us!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:28.010
The young master means business!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:30.600
Follow your commander, Gaku Ka Force!

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:35.350
Sir! New troops from the front!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.270
Finally!

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:41.110
Slaughter them.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:46.700
Left four squads, outside!
The right six squads, too!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:50.160
Huh? What's with that frilly red robe?

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:52.580
Don't tell me that's their <i>commander</i>!

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:57.750
Aw, hell. Those kinda
guys piss me off the most!

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.880
Mou Ten, sir!

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.170
Drop dead!

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:02.710
Schpang!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.130
Huh?

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.470
That--

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:06.590
Lightweight.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.420
Mou Ten!

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:13.060
Huh?! I'm <i>sure </i>I got him!

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:16.940
Break on through! Don't stop!

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:19.940
What's <i>his </i>deal?

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:24.610
You ain't goin' <i>anywhere</i>!
Crush 'em, Kou Yoku Force!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.700
"Gaku"
"Kou"

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:34.290
Schping!

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:38.130
This man... he's got weight.

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:39.540
You're <i>mi</i>--

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:45.920
He parried that?! And that first one, too?

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:48.970
Man, way to leave
it till the last second--

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:52.060
He dodged it?

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:55.600
Yikes! That was <i>way </i>too close!

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:02.440
This guy's tougher than he looks.

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:08.410
Let's see if that strength
of yours is for real...

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:10.740
He sheathed his sword?

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:14.450
...with my favorite blade, that is!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:16.710
Swapping swords...

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:18.580
Hey, look!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.170
Kou Yoku's done it!

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:22.880
His treasured sword...

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:27.050
Say your prayers, Lady Frillyfrock.

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:32.050
Wh-What the--?!

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:34.260
Another new batch of Chin troops!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:37.020
That army's a formidable one, Kou Yoku!

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:39.060
Is that...

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:43.270
One of Ou Ki's men--Roku O Mi!

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.820
What the hell?

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.990
They're just marching right
through the next squad over!

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:51.950
Cut the bullshit! What are you--

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:54.950
Wait... where'd he go?

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:58.710
Are you <i>sure </i>you don't want
to kill him? He was right there!

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:02.250
I don't have time
to engage someone like that!

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:04.670
The Tou Army--and the Gaku Ka Force--

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:06.460
are tasked with striking
the first So army

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.880
and drawing the second and
third armies out from behind it.

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:16.600
In short: to take the head of the
first So army's general, Rin Bu Kun!

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:18.850
The enemy's charging us head-on!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:21.560
They're past Ban You's squad!
Tighten the front line!

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.520
Don't let them approach our main camp!

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:36.370
Astonishing. They mean to barrel
straight through to the enemy HQ?!

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:40.000
Roku O Mi's camp was
already situated out front.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:41.750
But even so...

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:46.130
Who knew they still had such power,
even after losing Ou Ki?

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:50.170
They made it past our final garrison?!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:52.380
But that's absurd!

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:54.720
I'd written him off as Ou Ki's remnant.

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:56.010
"Tou"

00:17:57.140 --> 00:18:02.350
But Roku O Mi wasn't commander
of Ou Ki's first army for nothing!

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:04.690
So you're Rin Bu Kun!

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:08.650
I'll chop up your ridiculous head

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:12.700
to feed Dou Kin in the afterworld!

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:14.820
Are they going to duel?!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:20.330
Seriously? Doesn't Rin Bu Kun realize
he's the first-army general?

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:21.910
A duel!

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:25.170
This should be an easy win for Roku O Mi!

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:29.250
We don't know that! Their general's
confident enough to engage him.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.510
We have to hurry!

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:31.510
Sir!

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:41.180
Oh? You're quite strong. You must
have a lot of battles under your belt.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:44.140
Though your sense of aesthetics
is somewhat lacking.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:48.230
Men like you must be crushed
by a commander himself.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.820
Only then will Chin realize
they're no match for--

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:51.860
Hmm?

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:57.620
Hold a moment, Roku O Mi.

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:59.160
Rin Bou?

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:03.250
There's something I must ask
this man before you do the deed:

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:09.630
What sort of high-minded reasoning
could possibly be behind

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:13.130
that outlandish hairstyle of yours?

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:15.550
Another squad's shown up at our main camp!

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:18.050
Dammit! We're not gonna make it!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.720
Stand down. He's <i>my </i>prey.

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.390
I will not.

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:25.520
What's wrong with teaming up occasionally?

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:28.770
This bout will also serve
to avenge Dou Kin!

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:30.070
Tch!

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:31.570
Two against one?!

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.280
Rin Bu Kun!

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:47.790
Rin Bou!

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:52.760
Sir!

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:59.220
That strike on Rin Bou was no fluke.

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:02.680
There's an ace archer out there somewhere!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:05.560
No butting in, Haku Rei!

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:08.850
"So"

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:09.310
Butting in?

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:14.280
I can't just stand by and watch as the
enemy gets ever closer to our main camp!

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:18.070
If you die here,
the first army will fall apart...

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:20.780
...and my big sister will become a widow.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.080
It came from over there!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:29.120
No way--is <i>that</i>--

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:32.670
Did he really finish off Rin Bou
from that distance?

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:35.960
No ordinary archer has such skill.

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:38.680
This is much too dangerous.

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:41.930
Gaku Ka Force! Split into
two squads: front and rear!

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:43.930
The rear half will head to the main camp,

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:46.850
and the front half will follow me!

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:54.190
Sir!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.780
I'm fine!

00:20:55.780 --> 00:21:00.950
As long as Roku O Mi here knows arrows
are flying, there's no hitting him!

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:03.700
Ha. Just how long can you keep this up?

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.080
Mou Ten, sir, we're going in too deep!

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:13.630
There's not an ally in sight.
We won't be able to escape!

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:16.510
For a general who personally appears
on such a mixed-up battlefield,

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:19.170
that expert archer is a real threat.

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:23.550
We've got to take him out fast--for
the sake of future battles!

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:27.390
I see him! That man over there!

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:28.430
Riku Sen!

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:29.640
Right!

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:31.650
Heavy cavalry, this way!

00:21:33.610 --> 00:21:36.530
Sir! The enemy is nearly upon us!

00:21:36.530 --> 00:21:39.030
Fight them off with arrows. Fire at will!

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:40.650
Fire!

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:48.160
Gaku Ka's heavy cavalry
is made of tough stuff!

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:52.540
Use your spears on the man in the cart!

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:54.210
Haku Rei, sir!

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:58.130
What the hell are you doing?!

00:21:58.130 --> 00:22:00.420
The commander in the crested helmet--

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:02.180
get him!

00:22:02.180 --> 00:22:05.100
And send out <i>our</i>
heavy calvary--on the double!

00:22:05.100 --> 00:22:06.180
Sir!

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:15.110
No--

00:22:19.280 --> 00:22:20.860
Take <i>that</i>!

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:28.120
Mou Ten!

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:32.870
Couldn't dodge <i>that </i>one, now, could ya?

00:22:32.870 --> 00:22:35.670
Sure was a close one, though, eh, Rei?

00:22:35.670 --> 00:22:38.170
That's a hundred times
I've saved your ass.

00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:40.420
And two hundred times I've saved yours.

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:44.090
Yeah, right!

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:45.470
Eh?

00:22:48.350 --> 00:22:49.810
Now, then:

00:22:49.810 --> 00:22:55.060
How should I kill the bastard who
dared go after my righthand man Rei?

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:57.060
Who are you calling your righthand man?

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:59.780
Quit taunting him, you idiot. Stand down.

00:22:59.780 --> 00:23:01.820
I'll put a single arrow through him.

00:23:01.820 --> 00:23:03.110
Tch.

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:09.450
"Gyoku"

00:23:18.590 --> 00:23:21.090
You're in the way. Move.

